Omnitrix exploration and exploitation: findings and repair log</title><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 24px;color:#1b2938;background:#f5f7fa}article,details{background:white;border:1px solid #d6dee8;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin:16px 0}h1,h2{line-height:1.25}h2{font-size:20px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px}td,th{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ccd6e3;padding:8px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.status{font-weight:700;color:#245aa0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}</style><body><h1>Omnitrix exploration and exploitation: findings and repair log</h1><pre>{
